### Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Effort | Rationale |
|----------|-------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | Low | Silent false-pass — highest risk of hiding bugs |
| 2 | Conditional Test Logic | Low | Hidden gap; split into 2 tests |
| 3 | Mystery Guest | Low | Blocks CI/other devs immediately |
| 4 | Sleepy Test | Medium | Flakiness + 2 s wall-clock cost per run |
| 5 | Exception Handling | Low | One-line replacement with `Assert.ThrowsException` |
| 6 | Magic Number Test | Low | Readability; add named constants |
| 7 | Sensitive Equality | Medium | Requires summary to expose properties |
| 8 | Eager Test | Medium | Consider marking as integration or splitting |
| 9 | General Fixture | Low | Remove unused field |

